Subject to certain rules, you will be able to significantly reduce the risk of back neuralgia.
To prevent pain, follow these guidelines:
- Do warm-up before doing sports;
- Avoid stress, worries, worries;
- Eat fully and correctly;
- Try to sleep at least 8 hours a day;
- Do your best to harden the body;
- Drink vitamin complexes regularly;
- Visit the pool;
- Walk outdoors as often as possible;
- Get rid of all pathogenic processes in a timely manner.
Neuralgia of the back is an extremely painful process due to which a person cannot move. If the first signs of this condition appear, consult a doctor immediately. Do not poison yourself with chemical drugs that only stop the pain. It is necessary to deal with the cause of discomfort.
